//// set: vc-p1 — 模型语境向量化调用的范围切片实参（整条保留 / 带步长 / 结构参数界 / 二维 / 运算里 / sum 里）；der、previous、pre 的切片逐元素（VSL1-VSL10）
//// model: VSL1
model VSL1
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3 * time};
  Real y[2];
equation
  y = g(x[2:3]);
end VSL1;
//// model: VSL2
model VSL2
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3 * time};
  Real y[2] = g(x[2:3]);
end VSL2;
//// model: VSL3
model VSL3
  Real x[3](each start = 1, each fixed = true);
equation
  der(x[1:2]) = {-x[1], -x[2]};
  der(x[3]) = 0;
end VSL3;
//// model: VSL4
model VSL4
  parameter Integer n = 2;
  Real u = sample(time, Clock(0.1));
  Real ub[n + 1](each start = 0.0);
equation
  ub = cat(1, {u}, previous(ub[1:n]));
end VSL4;
//// model: VSL5
model VSL5
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3 * time};
  Real y[2];
equation
  y = g(x[1:2:3]);
end VSL5;
//// model: VSL6
model VSL6
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  parameter Integer n = 2;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3 * time};
  Real y[n];
equation
  y = g(x[1:n]);
end VSL6;
//// model: VSL7
model VSL7
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  Real m[3, 2] = {{time, 1}, {2, time}, {3, 4}};
  Real y[2, 2];
equation
  y = g(m[1:2, :]);
end VSL7;
//// model: VSL8
model VSL8
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3 * time};
  Real y[2];
equation
  y = 2 * g(x[2:3]);
end VSL8;
//// model: VSL9
model VSL9
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3 * time};
  Real s = sum(g(x[2:3]));
end VSL9;
//// model: VSL10
model VSL10
  Integer c[3](each start = 0, each fixed = true);
algorithm
  when sample(0, 0.1) then
    c[2:3] := pre(c[1:2]) + {1, 1};
    c[1] := pre(c[1]) + 1;
  end when;
end VSL10;
//// model: VSL11
model VSL11
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function f
    input Real u[3];
    output Real a[3];
  protected
    Real w[3];
  algorithm
    w := u;
    a := g(w[1:3]);
  end f;
  Real r[:] = f({time, 2, 3});
end VSL11;
